{"id":50838,"date":"2026-08-26T10:00:00","date_gmt":"2026-08-26T09:00:00","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=50838"},"modified":"2026-09-03T01:26:24","modified_gmt":"2026-09-03T00:26:24","slug":"trilho-do-neveiro","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/trilho-do-neveiro\/","title":{"rendered":"5\u00aa Edi\u00e7\u00e3o Trilho do Neveiro 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">5\u00aa Edi\u00e7\u00e3o Trilho do Neveiro 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>5\u00aa Edi\u00e7\u00e3o Trilho do Neveiro 2026<\/strong> realiza-se no domingo, <strong>8 de Novembro de 2026<\/strong>, no id\u00edlico concelho de <strong>Castanheira de Pera<\/strong>, distrito de <strong>Leiria<\/strong>. Organizado pela <strong>Prazil\u00e2ndia Turismo e Ambiente E.M.<\/strong> com o apoio do <strong>Munic\u00edpio de Castanheira de Pera<\/strong> e da Uni\u00e3o das Freguesias de Castanheira de Pera e Coentral, o evento presta homenagem \u00e0 secular rota dos neveiros que transportavam gelo natural da Serra da Lous\u00e3 para a corte real em Lisboa no s\u00e9culo XVIII.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Com partida e meta junto \u00e0 <strong>Igreja de S\u00e3o Sebasti\u00e3o, em Pera<\/strong>, a prova oferece o <strong>Trilho Longo (32 km)<\/strong> \u00e0s <strong>09h15<\/strong>, o <strong>Trilho Curto (19 km)<\/strong> \u00e0s <strong>09h25<\/strong>, o <strong>Mini Trilho (10 km)<\/strong> \u00e0s <strong>09h35<\/strong> e a <strong>Caminhada (10 km)<\/strong> \u00e0s <strong>09h45<\/strong>. Os percursos sobem a encosta sul da Serra da Lous\u00e3 at\u00e9 ao alto de Santo Ant\u00f3nio da Neve, passando pelos monumentais Po\u00e7os da Neve do Coentral, oferecendo vistas de cortar a respira\u00e7\u00e3o, camisola oficial, pr\u00e9mio finisher e op\u00e7\u00e3o de almo\u00e7o conv\u00edvio.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data &#038; Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\"