question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza o Trilho do Neveiro 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento realiza-se no domingo, <strong>8 de Novembro de 2026<\/strong>, junto \u00e0 <strong>Igreja de S\u00e3o Sebasti\u00e3o<\/strong>, na aldeia de Pera (Castanheira de Pera).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias e hor\u00e1rios de partida?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O <strong>Trilho Longo de 32 km<\/strong> parte \u00e0s 09h15, o <strong>Trilho Curto de 19 km<\/strong> \u00e0s 09h25, o <strong>Mini Trilho de 10 km<\/strong> \u00e0s 09h35 e a <strong>Caminhada de 10 km<\/strong> \u00e0s 09h45.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 o significado hist\u00f3rico da rota dos Neveiros?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Os trilhos percorrem a rota hist\u00f3rica onde os neveiros do Coentral guardavam o gelo nos po\u00e7os da serra para abastecer a corte real de Lisboa nos s\u00e9culos XVIII e XIX.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">O evento disponibiliza transporte a partir de Lisboa?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Sim, a organiza\u00e7\u00e3o disponibiliza opcionalmente um autocarro com sa\u00edda \u00e0s 05h30 de Lisboa para os participantes que selecionarem esse servi\u00e7o na inscri\u00e7\u00e3o.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde posso efetuar a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o oficial?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es realizam-se online atrav\u00e9s da plataforma <a href=\"https:\/\/stopandgo.net\/events\/trilho-do-neveiro-2026\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Stop&#038;Go<\/a> at\u00e9 1 de novembro de 2026.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"5\u00aa Edi\u00e7\u00e3o Trilho do Neveiro 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-11-08\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Igreja de S\u00e3o Sebasti\u00e3o, Pera, Castanheira de Pera, Leiria\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Castanheira de Pera\", \"addressRegion\": \"Leiria\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Prazil\u00e2ndia E.M., Munic\u00edpio de Castanheira de Pera e UF de Castanheira de Pera e Coentral\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando e onde se realiza o Trilho do Neveiro 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O evento realiza-se no domingo, 8 de Novembro de 2026 , junto \u00e0 Igreja de S\u00e3o Sebasti\u00e3o , na aldeia de Pera (Castanheira de Pera).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias e hor\u00e1rios de partida?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O Trilho Longo de 32 km parte \u00e0s 09h15, o Trilho Curto de 19 km \u00e0s 09h25, o Mini Trilho de 10 km \u00e0s 09h35 e a Caminhada de 10 km \u00e0s 09h45.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 o significado hist\u00f3rico da rota dos Neveiros?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Os trilhos percorrem a rota hist\u00f3rica onde os neveiros do Coentral guardavam o gelo nos po\u00e7os da serra para abastecer a corte real de Lisboa nos s\u00e9culos XVIII e XIX.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"O evento disponibiliza transporte a partir de Lisboa?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Sim, a organiza\u00e7\u00e3o disponibiliza opcionalmente um autocarro com sa\u00edda \u00e0s 05h30 de Lisboa para os participantes que selecionarem esse servi\u00e7o na inscri\u00e7\u00e3o.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde posso efetuar a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o oficial?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es realizam-se online atrav\u00e9s da plataforma Stop&Go at\u00e9 1 de novembro de 2026.\"}}]}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":50839,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"e